.worktrees/
config.toml
*.local
.DS_Store

# Run evidence is local to this instance and never committed. postmaster is a tool others
# run against their own projects: a run's ledger, narrative and harness sessions carry that
# instance's paths, ticket text and whatever was on screen, and this repo is public. The
# wiki commits what it compiled, not what it compiled from (raw/README.md is the contract,
# and is kept).
raw/*
!raw/README.md
